# Conflict fixture: broad glob followed by a more-specific path rule.
#
# Pattern precedence (GitHub semantics): LAST matching rule wins.
#
# For the file `src/payments/invoice.ts`:
#   1. `*`           matches → owners: @global-owner          (overridden)
#   2. `src/**`      matches → owners: @backend-team          (overridden)
#   3. `src/payments` matches → owners: @payments-team        ← WINS
#
# For the file `src/horizon.ts`:
#   1. `*`           matches → owners: @global-owner          (overridden)
#   2. `src/**`      matches → owners: @backend-team          ← WINS
#   (rule 3 does not match)
#
# For the file `README.md`:
#   1. `*`           matches → owners: @global-owner          ← WINS
#   (rules 2 and 3 do not match)

*                 @global-owner
src/**            @backend-team
src/payments      @payments-team
